# Load the same quasi-connectivity structure the oracle ran, and check every block
# arrived. The region is sized from the structure plus padding automatically.
#
# No behaviour is registered in the corpus runner, so nothing simulates here —
# this case is about the load path being faithful, which is the prerequisite for
# comparing against a vanilla trace at all.

load piston_qc.snbt

expect block 0 1 0 minecraft:piston[extended=false,facing=east]
expect block 1 2 0 minecraft:redstone_block
expect block 1 1 0 minecraft:stone
expect non_air_count 5
